# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# These files are held to a SHA-256 (the vendored htmx, its integrity value in the shell,
# and the escaping vectors copied verbatim from ikigai-fn), and devtools `vector-drift`
# compares verbatim copies byte for byte, so a CRLF checkout would be drift.
vendor/* -text
src/testkit/*.json text eol=lf
assets/* text eol=lf
